  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you, or a Bloodied creature you can see within 60 feet of you, are hit by an attack roll, you can take a Reaction to halve that attack's damage (round down). If the attack roll was a Critical Hit, any effects triggered by the Critical Hit are canceled. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
